  {
   "quote": "Lagoon talks of more than 40 square metres of living space spread across three zones. For a catamaran of this size, that is remarkable, and underlines the ambition to push onboard life even further outdoors — with short circulation routes, open sightlines and several lounge areas that can be used interchangeably.",
